      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CLASSY BANDIT (1) could manage only eighth at this track last time but impressed when posting an outstanding 29.59 over 520m at this track the start prior. Can measure up again if runs up to recent best times. MY BREAD ROLL (3) was a winner two back then strongly fancied last time but could only manage a second (22.81) at The Gardens. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Expected to be in the finish again. DYNAMIC DRUMMER (2) had been in super honest form hitting the frame two times on end before finishing fifth (30.44) at this track last time. Form here at the trip sound including two wins. Has performed well from this box with a win and three minor placings to his name from eight starts. Deserves plenty of respect. ETHANOL SECRET (8) is sure to play a big role again after a run of minor placings.",
